//! Coronal-equilibrium cooling curves and mean charge states for seeded
//! impurities, derived from OpenADAS adf11 data (open.adas.ac.uk, the
//! Atomic Data and Analysis Structure, H. P. Summers et al.) at an electron
//! density of 1e20 m^-3: ionisation balance from scd/acd, radiated power from
//! plt (line) and prb (recombination + bremsstrahlung). Generated by
//! tools/adas_cooling/ (do not edit by hand). Values are coronal: in a cold,
//! dense divertor with finite impurity residence time the low-Z species
//! radiate more than this (non-coronal enhancement), which the detachment
//! model accounts for separately through its own calibration.

/// One row of a cooling table: (T_e [eV], L_z [W m^3], <Z>, <Z^2>).
pub type CoolingRow = (f64, f64, f64, f64);

